%% Lumine Critical Path — every trade decision
%% Rendered in docs/01-architecture/ and docs/08-trading/.
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant TC as trade-core
    participant LLM as LLM Committee
    participant RV as RiskValidator
    participant PS as PortfolioSizer
    participant ER as ExecutionRouter
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant BR as MT5 Bridge

    S->>TC: trigger
    TC->>LLM: analysts (parallel) + debate + IC + CIO
    LLM-->>TC: proposal
    TC->>RV: proposal
    RV-->>TC: APPROVE | REJECT | MODIFY
    alt APPROVE
        TC->>PS: proposal
        PS-->>TC: sized order
        TC->>ER: sized order
        ER->>DB: BEGIN TX
        ER->>DB: INSERT lineage_records (blocking ACID)
        DB-->>ER: COMMIT (must succeed)
        alt commit fails
            ER-->>TC: safe state, NO dispatch
        else commit succeeds
            ER->>BR: publish mt5.commands
            BR-->>ER: fill
            ER->>DB: INSERT fills, UPDATE positions
        end
    end
    Note over RV: No LLM sits above RiskValidator.<br/>Kill switch read every cycle.
